So for bricks:
If hitting TOP face: `ball.y = brick.y - ball.r; ball.vy = Math.abs(ball.vy) * UP;`
If hitting BOTTOM face: `ball.y = brick.y + brick.h + ball.r; ball.vy = Math.abs(ball.vy) * DOWN;`
